<!-- ============ WHAT WE'LL COVER ============ -->
<section class="section" style="padding-top: 40px;">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header">
      <div class="section-eyebrow">The agenda is yours</div>
      <h2 class="section-title">Bring the hard questions.</h2>
      <p class="section-sub">Tell us which of these matter and we'll bring the people who own them — not an account executive relaying answers.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="mini-grid">
      <div class="mini-card">
        <div class="mini-ico"><i class="ti ti-server-cog"></i></div>
        <h3>Architecture &amp; Hosting</h3>
        <p>How the platform is deployed and isolated, what runs on Google Cloud, and what other providers or hybrid arrangements are supported for your regions.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="mini-card">
        <div class="mini-ico"><i class="ti ti-shield-lock"></i></div>
        <h3>Security &amp; Compliance Review</h3>
        <p>Walk your security questionnaire through with us. SOC 2 Type 2, PCI DSS, GDPR, and the fiscal certifications for each market you operate in.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="mini-card">
        <div class="mini-ico"><i class="ti ti-plug-connected"></i></div>
        <h3>Integration Mapping</h3>
        <p>Your ERP, e-commerce, OMS, WMS, and payments stack against our integration surface — including which patterns we've already built for retailers your size.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="mini-card">
        <div class="mini-ico"><i class="ti ti-arrow-guide"></i></div>
        <h3>Migration &amp; Cutover</h3>
        <p>Running alongside your incumbent POS, moving historical transaction and customer data, phasing by region, and what rollback looks like if a wave goes badly.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="mini-card">
        <div class="mini-ico"><i class="ti ti-users-group"></i></div>
        <h3>Identity &amp; Access</h3>
        <p>How associates and corporate users authenticate across a fleet, what's attributable in the audit trail, and the options where biometric sign-in isn't appropriate.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="mini-card">
        <div class="mini-ico"><i class="ti ti-device-desktop-cog"></i></div>
        <h3>Devices &amp; Fleet Operations</h3>
        <p>The iOS estate — hardware selection, device management, RFID readers and peripherals, and how terminals are provisioned and replaced at scale.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

